DATA NOTICE: graphB+

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  graph.tar.gz -> graph.csv

What:
  A signed, weighted edge list for graph balancing.

Source:
  ECL graphB+ (Martin Burtscher, Texas State University),
  https://userweb.cs.txstate.edu/~burtscher/research/graphB/. The
  network the graph comes from is not recorded. Not compared byte for
  byte.

Copyright:
  ECL code: Copyright 2021, Texas State University. Graph: unknown.

License:
  The ECL code is BSD-3-Clause (see main.cu). No license is stated for
  the graph.

Used by:
  graphB+-cuda, graphB+-hip, graphB+-sycl

Notes:
  Numeric node IDs and edge signs only.

This data keeps its upstream license. HeCBench's top-level BSD-3-Clause
LICENSE does not apply to it.
